  "faq.ads.a": "No. Pienipeli has no ads at all, so there is nothing for little fingers to tap by accident.",
  "faq.ads.q": "Do the games have ads?",
  "faq.age.a": "Babies and toddlers, roughly ages 1 to 4. Each game shows a suggested age. They need no reading, and every tap does something fun.",
  "faq.age.q": "What age are the games for?",
  "faq.data.a": "No. There are no accounts, analytics, cookies or trackers. A few small settings (like sound on or off and your language) are saved only on your own device.",
  "faq.data.q": "Do you collect any data about my child?",
  "faq.free.a": "Yes. Every game is completely free to play. There are no in-app purchases, subscriptions or hidden costs, and there never will be.",
  "faq.free.q": "Are Pienipeli games really free?",
  "faq.homescreen.a": "Yes. On iPhone or iPad tap Share, then Add to Home Screen. On Android open the browser menu and choose Install app or Add to Home screen. Each game gets its own icon, opens full screen, and works without internet once it has been opened.",
  "faq.homescreen.q": "Can I put a game on my home screen like an app?",
  "faq.howlong.a": "Short and sweet is best: a few minutes together, then off to something else. The games never push to keep playing: no streaks, rewards or “one more level”.",
  "faq.howlong.q": "How long should my toddler play?",
  "faq.install.a": "No. The games run in your web browser on phones, tablets (including iPad) and computers. There is no app to download and no account to create.",
